"# Roadmap Guide\n"
"\n"
"## Overview\n"
"This document provides a detailed roadmap for the project, outlining key milestones, deliverables, and timelines. It is intended to guide the team through the development process, ensuring alignment with project goals and stakeholder expectations.\n"
"\n"
"## Milestones\n"
"\n"
"### Phase 1: Planning and Requirements\n"
"- **Duration**: Weeks 1-2\n"
"- **Objectives**:\n"
"  - Gather and document detailed requirements.\n"
"  - Define project scope and success criteria.\n"
"  - Identify key stakeholders and establish communication channels.\n"
"- **Deliverables**:\n"
"  - Requirements specification document.\n"
"  - Project charter.\n"
"  - Stakeholder communication plan.\n"
"\n"
"### Phase 2: Design and Prototyping\n"
"- **Duration**: Weeks 3-6\n"
"- **Objectives**:\n"
"  - Develop architectural design and technical specifications.\n"
"  - Create wireframes and prototypes for user feedback.\n"
"  - Validate design assumptions with stakeholders.\n"
"- **Deliverables**:\n"
"  - System architecture document.\n"
"  - Prototype and wireframes.\n"
"  - Design validation report.\n"
"\n"
"### Phase 3: Development\n"
"- **Duration**: Weeks 7-16\n"
"- **Objectives**:\n"
"  - Implement core features based on approved designs.\n"
"  - Conduct regular code reviews and maintain code quality.\n"
"  - Integrate third-party services and APIs as required.\n"
"- **Deliverables**:\n"
"  - Functional software builds.\n"
"  - Code repository with version control.\n"
"  - Integration documentation.\n"
"\n"
"### Phase 4: Testing and Quality Assurance\n"
"- **Duration**: Weeks 17-20\n"
"- **Objectives**:\n"
"  - Perform comprehensive testing (unit, integration, system, and UAT).\n"
"  - Identify and resolve defects and performance issues.\n"
"  - Ensure compliance with security and data protection standards.\n"
"- **Deliverables**:\n"
"  - Test plans and test cases.\n"
"  - QA reports and defect logs.\n"
"  - Security and compliance certification.\n"
"\n"
"### Phase 5: Deployment and Release\n"
"- **Duration**: Weeks 21-24\n"
"- **Objectives**:\n"
"  - Prepare deployment environment and release plan.\n"
"  - Execute deployment with minimal disruption.\n"
"  - Provide training and documentation for end-users.\n"
"- **Deliverables**:\n"
"  - Deployment plan and runbook.\n"
"  - Release notes and user manuals.\n"
"  - Training materials and sessions.\n"
"\n"
"### Phase 6: Post-Release Support and Maintenance\n"
"- **Duration**: Ongoing after release\n"
"- **Objectives**:\n"
"  - Monitor system performance and user feedback.\n"
"  - Provide timely bug fixes and updates.\n"
"  - Plan for future enhancements based on user needs.\n"
"- **Deliverables**:\n"
"  - Support and maintenance plan.\n"
"  - Regular status reports.\n"
"  - Enhancement roadmap.\n"
"\n"
"## Timeline Overview\n"
"\n"
"| Phase | Duration | Key Deliverables |\n"
"|-------|----------|------------------|\n"
"| Planning and Requirements | Weeks 1-2 | Requirements spec, project charter |\n"
"| Design and Prototyping | Weeks 3-6 | Architecture doc, prototypes |\n"
"| Development | Weeks 7-16 | Software builds, code repository |\n"
"| Testing and QA | Weeks 17-20 | Test plans, QA reports |\n"
"| Deployment and Release | Weeks 21-24 | Deployment plan, user manuals |\n"
"| Post-Release Support | Ongoing | Support plan, enhancement roadmap |\n"
"\n"
"## Conclusion\n"
"This roadmap serves as a living document that will be updated as the project evolves. Regular reviews and adjustments will ensure that the project remains on track and responsive to changing requirements.\n"

msgid "Roadmap指导"
msgstr "Roadmap Guide"

msgid "使用 GitHub Issue 来跟踪和管理各组织的计划及中长期目标。本文档为社区项目编写路线图类 Issue 提供参考和规范，以帮助创建和维护高质量的路线图。"
msgstr "Use GitHub Issues to track and manage the plans and mid-to-long-term goals of each organization. This document provides reference and guidelines for community projects when writing roadmap-type Issues, aiming to help create and maintain high-quality roadmaps."

msgid "下面是一个完整的路线图 Issue 示例，展示了所有推荐元素的实际应用。建议先查看此示例获得整体印象，再阅读后续的详细规范说明。"
msgstr "Below is a complete roadmap issue example, demonstrating the practical application of all recommended elements. It is advisable to first review this example to gain an overall impression, and then read the subsequent detailed specification instructions."

msgid "1. 标题格式"
msgstr "1. Heading format"

msgid "**格式：** `[Roadmap] <Project Name> Roadmap <Time Range>`，季度发布使用 Q1/Q2/Q3/Q4 标记，半年度发布使用 H1/H2 标记"
msgstr "**Format:** `[Roadmap] <Project Name> Roadmap <Time Range>`, with quarterly releases marked using Q1/Q2/Q3/Q4, and semi-annual releases marked using H1/H2."

msgid "**示例：**"
msgstr "**Example:**"

msgid "`[Roadmap] Triton-Ascend Roadmap 2026 Q2`"
msgstr "[Roadmap] Triton-Ascend Roadmap 2026 Q2"

msgid "`[Roadmap] Triton-Ascend Roadmap 2026 H1`"
msgstr "`[Roadmap] Triton-Ascend Roadmap 2026 H1`"

msgid "2. 顶层内容"
msgstr "2. Top-level content"

msgid "2.1 开篇描述（可选）"
msgstr "2.1 Opening Description (Optional)"

msgid "提供项目概述、愿景或整体方向的简要总结。例如，简要描述 Triton-Ascend 本季度在上游对齐、后端性能和算子覆盖方面的目标。"
msgstr "Provide a brief summary of the project overview, vision, or overall direction. For example, briefly describe Triton-Ascend's goals this quarter in terms of upstream alignment, backend performance, and operator coverage."

msgid "2.2 重点方向章节"
msgstr "2.2 Key Focus Areas Section"

msgid "列出本周期最关键的 3-5 个重点方向，建议按项目的**功能领域**或**技术模块**分组，覆盖全局视角："
msgstr "List the 3-5 most critical focus areas for this cycle, recommended to be grouped by the project's **functional domains** or **technical modules**, covering a global perspective:"

msgid "**特征：**"
msgstr "**Features:**"

msgid "高层次概括和描述当前周期项目的主要开发方向，无需详细展开"
msgstr "High-level summary and description of the main development directions for the current cycle project, without the need for detailed elaboration."

msgid "3. 主要功能模块章节"
msgstr "3. Main Functional Modules Section"

msgid "3.1 章节划分原则"
msgstr "3.1 Chapter Division Principles"

msgid "按项目的**功能领域**或**技术模块**分组，例如："
msgstr "Group by the project's **functional areas** or **technical modules**, for example:"

msgid "**Upstream Compatibility** - Upstream Triton frontend and IR alignment"
msgstr "**Upstream Compatibility** - Alignment with upstream Triton frontend and IR"

msgid "**Backend Performance** - Ascend NPU backend kernel generation and memory optimization"
msgstr "**Backend Performance** - Ascend NPU backend kernel generation and memory optimization"

msgid "**Operator Coverage** - Triton built-in ops and dtype support on Ascend"
msgstr "**Operator Coverage** - Triton built-in ops and dtype support on Ascend"

msgid "**Usability** - Debugging tools and error reporting"
msgstr "**可用性** - 调试工具与错误报告"

msgid "**Ecosystem Integration** - Integration with training/inference frameworks"
msgstr "**生态系统集成** - 与训练/推理框架的集成"

msgid "3.2 各模块结构"
msgstr "3.2 Module Structures"

msgid "每个模块包含多个**具体工作项**，格式如下："
msgstr "Each module contains multiple **specific work items**, formatted as follows:"

msgid "4. 关键元数据字段"
msgstr "4. Key Metadata Fields"

msgid "每个工作项应包含以下关键信息："
msgstr "Each work item should include the following key information:"

msgid "4.1 目标（Goal）"
msgstr "4.1 Goal"

msgid "**含义**：工作目标或简要描述"
msgstr "**Meaning**: Work objective or brief description"

msgid "**用法**：说明该工作项的目标"
msgstr "**Usage**: Describes the objective of this work item."

msgid "**示例**：`目标：在昇腾后端 tl.dot 中支持 FP8（E4M3/E5M2）数据类型`"
msgstr "**Example**: `Goal: Support FP8 (E4M3/E5M2) data types in tl.dot on the Ascend backend`"

msgid "4.2 负责人（Owner）"
msgstr "4.2 Owner"

msgid "**含义**：责任人"
msgstr "**Meaning**: Responsible Person"

msgid "**格式**：`负责人：@GitHubID`"
msgstr "**Format**: `Owner: @GitHubID`"

msgid "**用法**：明确谁负责或主导该工作项"
msgstr "**Usage**: Clearly indicate who is responsible for or leads the work item."

msgid "**示例**：`负责人：@contributor-a`"
msgstr "**Example**: `Lead: @contributor-a`"

msgid "4.3 Issue"
msgstr "4.3 Issue"

msgid "**含义**：关联的 GitHub Issue"
msgstr "**Meaning**: Associated GitHub Issue"

msgid "**格式**：`Issue：<Issue 链接>`"
msgstr "**Format**: `Issue: <Issue link>`"

msgid "**用法**：跟踪详细设计和讨论"
msgstr "**Usage**: Track detailed design and discussion."

msgid "**示例**：`Issue：https://github.com/triton-lang/triton-ascend/issues`"
msgstr "**Example**: `Issue: https://github.com/triton-lang/triton-ascend/issues`"

msgid "4.4 PR（Pull Request）"
msgstr "4.4 PR (Pull Request)"

msgid "**含义**：相关实现 PR"
msgstr "**Meaning**: Related implementation PR"

msgid "**格式**：`PR：<PR 链接>`"
msgstr "**Format**: `PR: <PR link>`"

msgid "**用法**：关联实现工作"
msgstr "**Usage**: Associate implementation work"

msgid "**示例**：`PR：https://github.com/triton-lang/triton-ascend/pulls`"
msgstr "**Example**: `PR: https://github.com/triton-lang/triton-ascend/pulls`"

msgid "5. 可选补充内容"
msgstr "5. Optional Supplementary Content"

msgid "5.1 🙋 欢迎贡献标记"
msgstr "5.1 🙋 Welcome Contribution Markers"

msgid "对于特别欢迎社区开发者贡献的工作项，建议使用 **[🙋 欢迎贡献]** 标记来标识："
msgstr "For work items that particularly welcome contributions from community developers, it is recommended to use the **[🙋 Welcome Contributions]** tag to mark them."

msgid "5.2 子 Issue"
msgstr "5.2 Sub-issue"

msgid "在路线图 Issue 底部列出跨周期的相关路线图 Issue 或大工作项的分解 Issue。"
msgstr "List related cross-cycle roadmap issues or breakdown issues of large work items at the bottom of the roadmap issue."

msgid "**与工作项中 Issue 字段的区别：**"
msgstr "**Difference from the Issue field in work items:**"

msgid "**工作项中的 Issue 字段**：链接到该工作项的具体设计、讨论或跟踪 Issue"
msgstr "**Issue field in work items**: Links to the specific design, discussion, or tracking issue for the work item."

msgid "**子 Issue 章节**：用于关联其他周期的路线图 Issue（如上季度未完成的工作），或将大工作项分解为多个独立跟踪的子 Issue"
msgstr "**Sub-issue Section**: Used to link roadmap issues from other cycles (such as unfinished work from the previous quarter), or to break down large work items into multiple independently tracked sub-issues."
